# NAME|INPUT|RC|EXPECT
# Absent ORG or SUITE means fan out; inactive suites are skipped.
all-orgs-resolves-active-suite|leprechaun app launch -d|0|org=considera suite=consideraweb
all-suites-for-org|Considera app launch -d|0|suite=consideraweb
inactive-suite-skipped|Considera app launch -d|0|suite=consideraweb
single-project-base-case|ConsideraWeb api app launch -d|0|LPRE:EXEC fn=FnAppLaunch suite=consideraweb project=api
selected-projects-forwarded|ConsideraWeb app launch -p api bff -d|0|LPRE:EXEC fn=FnAppLaunch suite=consideraweb project= args= projects=api bff
all-projects-no-selection|ConsideraWeb app launch -d|0|LPRE:EXEC fn=FnAppLaunch suite=consideraweb project= args= projects=
